    "body": "Problem:\r\nurxvt doesn't support resetting to default cursor style like we assumed. https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/38987#issuecomment-5004636437\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nInstead of the reset sequence, always set it to steady block. This will still be wrong for users who configured their initial cursor to underline, but it's about the best we can do.\r\n\r\n@liskin I appreciate if you're able to verify. I already tested myself, but it seems like you must have some terminfo I don't if it was working for you before https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40249.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-18T01:07:59Z",
